<title>USA: May Department Stores sets $125 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>May Department Stores sets $125 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from May Department Stores Co was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER MAY DEPARTMENT STORES CO</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	  COUPON 7.45 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/2016</p>
<p>TYPE DEBEBTURES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	 YIELD 7.45 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A   SPREAD 64 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER U.S TREASURY 30-YEAR BOND --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
